调研' and '西峡县政协开展民主监督活动' but does not name the 县长 explicitly. Needs targeted web search or government leadership page access." /></attvalues></node><node id="3" label="张生起"><viz:size value="30.0" /><viz:shape value="diamond" /><viz:color r="60" g="180" b="60" a="0.85" /><attvalues><attvalue for="0" value="person" /><attvalue for="1" value="南阳市人大常委会主任（现职，非西峡）" /><attvalue for="2" value="南阳市人民代表大会常务委员会" /><attvalue for="3" value="男" /><attvalue for="4" value="汉族" /><attvalue for="5" value="1963年11月" /><attvalue for="6" value="Confirmed via scripts/build/build_南阳市_data.py and Wikipedia. Served as 西峡县委书记 before 2011. Now 南阳市人大常委会主任." /></attvalues></node><node id="4" label="待查（县委副书记）"><viz:size value="45.0" /><viz:shape value="square" /><viz:color r="220" g="80" b="80" a="0.9" /><attvalues><attvalue for="0" value="person" /><attvalue for="1" value="县委副书记（姓名待查）" /><attvalue for="2" value="中共西峡县委员会" /><attvalue for="6" value="Based on typical county leadership structure. Name unverified. Could be the same as the 县长 if the 县长 serves as deputy party secretary (standard pattern)." /></attvalues></node><node id="5" label="待查（常务副县长）"><viz:size value="50.0" /><viz:shape value="triangle" /><viz:color r="30" g="100" b="200" a="1.0" /><attvalues><attvalue for="0" value="person" /><attvalue for="1" value="县委常委、常务副县长（姓名待查）" /><attvalue for="2" value="西峡县人民政府" /><attvalue for="6" value="Typical county leadership structure includes a 常务副县长. Identity and name unverified." /></attvalues></node><node id="6" label="待查（人大常委会主任）"><viz:size value="30.0" /><viz:shape value="diamond" /><viz:color r="60" g="180" b="60" a="0.85" /><attvalues><attvalue for="0" value="person" /><attvalue for="1" value="县人大常委会主任（姓名待查）" /><attvalue for="2" value="西峡县人民代表大会常务委员会" /><attvalue for="6" value="County legislative head. Identity unverified. News mentions '西峡县人大常委会视察调研' but does not name the chair." /></attvalues></node><node id="7" label="待查（政协主席）"><viz:size value="30.0" /><viz:shape value="diamond" /><viz:color r="60" g="180" b="60" a="0.85" /><attvalues><attvalue for="0" value="person" /><attvalue for="1" value="县政协主席（姓名待查）" /><attvalue for="2" value="中国人民政治协商会议西峡县委员会" /><attvalue for="6" value="County political consultative head. Identity unverified. News mentions '西峡县政协开展民主监督活动' (2026-06-30) but does not name the chair." /></attvalues></node><node id="100001" label="中共西峡县委员会"><viz:size value="15.0" /><viz:shape value="hexagon" /><viz:color r="220" g="220" b="220" a="0.8" /><attvalues><attvalue for="0" value="organization" /><attvalue for="7" value="党委" /><attvalue for="8" value="县处级" /><attvalue for="9" value="西峡县" /></attvalues></node><node id="100002" label="西峡县人民政府"><viz:size value="15.0" /><viz:shape value="hexagon" /><viz:color r="220" g="220" b="220" a="0.8" /><attvalues><attvalue for="0" value="organization" /><attvalue for="7" value="政府" /><attvalue for="8" value="县处级" /><attvalue for="9" value="西峡县" /></attvalues></node><node id="100003" label="西峡县人民代表大会常务委员会"><viz:size value="15.0" /><viz:shape value="hexagon" /><viz:color r="220" g="220" b="220" a="0.8" /><attvalues><attvalue for="0" value="organization" /><attvalue for="7" value="人大" /><attvalue for="8" value="县处级" /><attvalue for="9" value="西峡县" /></attvalues></node><node id="100004" label="中国人民政治协商会议西峡县委员会"><viz:size value="15.0" /><viz:shape value="hexagon" /><viz:color r="220" g="220" b="220" a="0.8" /><attvalues><attvalue for="0" value="organization" /><attvalue for="7" value="政协" /><attvalue for="8" value="县处级" /><attvalue for="9" value="西峡县" /></attvalues></node><node id="100005" label="西峡县纪律检查委员会"><viz:size value="15.0" /><viz:shape value="hexagon" /><viz:color r="220" g="220" b="220" a="0.8" /><attvalues><attvalue for="0" value="organization" /><attvalue for="7" value="纪委" /><attvalue for="8" value="县处级" /><attvalue for="9" value="西峡县" /></attvalues></node><node id="100006" label="中共南阳市委"><viz:size value="15.0" /><viz:shape value="hexagon" /><viz:color r="220" g="220" b="220" a="0.8" /><attval